From 6a080a042d59e02a7a8ff20ae6694a6e6f3f8d46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 00:31:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] feat(uc-compat): registered models and model versions
 with artifact vending

Add uc_model and uc_model_version entities: integer version assignment
serialized via row locks, PENDING_REGISTRATION to READY finalize
lifecycle, artifact locations under the model's managed directory with
location-overlap checks extended across tabulars, volumes and model
versions. READ_WRITE credentials restricted to pending versions;
CatalogModelAction authorization with data-plane exclusions and OpenFGA
permission endpoints. Completes UC object-type coverage: volumes,
functions, models.
